  "schema_markdown": "# Database Schema\n\n## Table: dbo.BuildVersion\n\n### Columns:\n- Database Version (nvarchar)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- SystemInformationID (tinyint)\n- VersionDate (datetime)\n\n## Table: dbo.ErrorLog\n\n### Columns:\n- ErrorLine (int)\n- ErrorLogID (int)\n- ErrorMessage (nvarchar)\n- ErrorNumber (int)\n- ErrorProcedure (nvarchar)\n- ErrorSeverity (int)\n- ErrorState (int)\n- ErrorTime (datetime)\n- UserName (nvarchar)\n\n## Table: SalesLT.Address\n\n### Columns:\n- AddressID (int)\n- AddressLine1 (nvarchar)\n- AddressLine2 (nvarchar)\n- City (nvarchar)\n- CountryRegion (nvarchar)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- PostalCode (nvarchar)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n- StateProvince (nvarchar)\n\n## Table: SalesLT.Customer\n\n### Columns:\n- CompanyName (nvarchar)\n- CustomerID (int)\n- EmailAddress (nvarchar)\n- FirstName (nvarchar)\n- LastName (nvarchar)\n- MiddleName (nvarchar)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- NameStyle (bit)\n- PasswordHash (varchar)\n- PasswordSalt (varchar)\n- Phone (nvarchar)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n- SalesPerson (nvarchar)\n- Suffix (nvarchar)\n- Title (nvarchar)\n\n## Table: SalesLT.CustomerAddress\n\n### Columns:\n- AddressID (int)\n- AddressType (nvarchar)\n- CustomerID (int)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- AddressID ➡️ SalesLT.Address.AddressID\n- CustomerID ➡️ SalesLT.Customer.CustomerID\n\n## Table: SalesLT.Product\n\n### Columns:\n- Color (nvarchar)\n- DiscontinuedDate (datetime)\n- ListPrice (money)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- Name (nvarchar)\n- ProductCategoryID (int)\n- ProductID (int)\n- ProductModelID (int)\n- ProductNumber (nvarchar)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n- SellEndDate (datetime)\n- SellStartDate (datetime)\n- Size (nvarchar)\n- StandardCost (money)\n- ThumbNailPhoto (varbinary)\n- ThumbnailPhotoFileName (nvarchar)\n- Weight (decimal)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- ProductCategoryID ➡️ SalesLT.ProductCategory.ProductCategoryID\n- ProductModelID ➡️ SalesLT.ProductModel.ProductModelID\n\n## Table: SalesLT.ProductCategory\n\n### Columns:\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- Name (nvarchar)\n- ParentProductCategoryID (int)\n- ProductCategoryID (int)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- ParentProductCategoryID ➡️ SalesLT.ProductCategory.ProductCategoryID\n\n## Table: SalesLT.ProductDescription\n\n### Columns:\n- Description (nvarchar)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- ProductDescriptionID (int)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n\n## Table: SalesLT.ProductModel\n\n### Columns:\n- CatalogDescription (xml)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- Name (nvarchar)\n- ProductModelID (int)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n\n## Table: SalesLT.ProductModelProductDescription\n\n### Columns:\n- Culture (nchar)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- ProductDescriptionID (int)\n- ProductModelID (int)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- ProductDescriptionID ➡️ SalesLT.ProductDescription.ProductDescriptionID\n- ProductModelID ➡️ SalesLT.ProductModel.ProductModelID\n\n## Table: SalesLT.SalesOrderDetail\n\n### Columns:\n- LineTotal (numeric)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- OrderQty (smallint)\n- ProductID (int)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n- SalesOrderDetailID (int)\n- SalesOrderID (int)\n- UnitPrice (money)\n- UnitPriceDiscount (money)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- ProductID ➡️ SalesLT.Product.ProductID\n- SalesOrderID ➡️ SalesLT.SalesOrderHeader.SalesOrderID\n\n## Table: SalesLT.SalesOrderHeader\n\n### Columns:\n- AccountNumber (nvarchar)\n- BillToAddressID (int)\n- Comment (nvarchar)\n- CreditCardApprovalCode (varchar)\n- CustomerID (int)\n- DueDate (datetime)\n- Freight (money)\n- ModifiedDate (datetime)\n- OnlineOrderFlag (bit)\n- OrderDate (datetime)\n- PurchaseOrderNumber (nvarchar)\n- RevisionNumber (tinyint)\n- rowguid (uniqueidentifier)\n- SalesOrderID (int)\n- SalesOrderNumber (nvarchar)\n- ShipDate (datetime)\n- ShipMethod (nvarchar)\n- ShipToAddressID (int)\n- Status (tinyint)\n- SubTotal (money)\n- TaxAmt (money)\n- TotalDue (money)\n\n### Foreign Keys:\n- BillToAddressID ➡️ SalesLT.Address.AddressID\n- ShipToAddressID ➡️ SalesLT.Address.AddressID\n- CustomerID ➡️ SalesLT.Customer.CustomerID\n\n"
